.\" public-ip manual
.\" Author: athesto
.\" Drafted with assistance from ChatGPT
.TH PUBLIC-IP 1 "August 2026" "public-ip" "User Commands"

.SH NAME
public-ip \- track public IP address changes

.SH SYNOPSIS
.B public-ip
.RI [ OPTION " | " COMMAND ]

.SH DESCRIPTION
.B public-ip
retrieves the current public IP address and keeps a history of
address changes.

The current address is obtained from an external HTTP service.

.SH COMMANDS
.TP 12
.B current
Show the current public IP address.
This is the default command.

.TP
.B update
Check the current public IP address and append it to the history
if it differs from the last recorded address.

.TP
.B log
Show the public IP address history.

.TP
.B man
Show this manual.
If the manual is not available locally, it is downloaded first.

.SH OPTIONS
.TP 12
.B --help
Show a short help message and exit.

.TP
.B --version
Show the program version and exit.

.SH FILES
.TP 12
.I ~/.local/share/public-ip.log
History of detected public IP address changes.

.TP
.I ~/.local/share/man/man1/public-ip.1
Local copy of this manual.

.SH EXAMPLES
Show the current public IP:
.RS
.EX
public-ip
.EE
.RE

Explicitly request the current address:
.RS
.EX
public-ip current
.EE
.RE

Update the history:
.RS
.EX
public-ip update
.EE
.RE

Show previous addresses:
.RS
.EX
public-ip log
.EE
.RE

Show this manual:
.RS
.EX
public-ip man
.EE
.RE

.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Successful execution.

.TP
.B 1
An error occurred.

.SH BUGS
https://github.com/athesto/scripts/issues

.SH AUTHOR
athesto \- athesto.github.io

.SH SEE ALSO
.BR curl (1),
.BR ip (8),
.BR man (1)